                        "glosses": [
                            "Not considered.",
                            "Not carefully planned or thought through beforehand. (of an action or statement)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f74a96a-399d-4842-8151-855f8fc86155",
                                "sense_id": "08d55e66-389f-32db-9e65-110cd7a60595",
                                "text": "He proteſted to him, […] that this Flight of his ſhou'd be look'd on as a heat of Youth, and raſhneſs of a too forward Courage, and an unconſider'd impatience of Liberty, and no more; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "df1a40fb-2c31-4f8a-9a59-c4880e8de03f",
                                "sense_id": "08d55e66-389f-32db-9e65-110cd7a60595",
                                "text": "In his extreme desire to grasp dollars and power, the unintellectual exile was ready to throw himself into the arms of any wandering cut-throat whose help could be secured, and Babalatchi experienced great difficulty in restraining him from unconsidered violence."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "84e5948e-0952-4012-af0a-45ab796948e0",
                                "sense_id": "08d55e66-389f-32db-9e65-110cd7a60595",
                                "text": "If the remark were merely unconsidered, if on further reflection he would like to withdraw or amend it, I am sure the gesture would be appreciated."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "300c087d-3d56-3b4c-a8be-387a389f3d19",
                        "entry_id": "3b442300-e19a-3a38-ae27-dc780309485a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not considered.",
                            "Not noticed; not considered worthy of notice."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "507ce4c8-478a-4b77-b2ea-78b38d83e6af",
                                "sense_id": "300c087d-3d56-3b4c-a8be-387a389f3d19",
                                "text": "My father […] was likewise a snapper-up of unconsidered trifles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f5be3922-6798-4abc-a8c6-5f2497509782",
                                "sense_id": "300c087d-3d56-3b4c-a8be-387a389f3d19",
                                "text": "At length the auction began in the room below, whence they could hear each familiar article knocked down, the highly prized ones cheaply, the unconsidered at an unexpected price."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc75c1f7-68da-4650-92ad-b8c1cc662bb1",
                                "sense_id": "300c087d-3d56-3b4c-a8be-387a389f3d19",
                                "text": "She pointed to a draughty, unconsidered table by the door."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
